    "MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3": {
      "labels": {
        "L2196": 0,
        "L2198shortcutoption_MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_1": 8,
        "L2199shortcutoption_MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_2": 11,
        "L2197group_end": 14
      },
      "instructions": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "opcode": 2,
          "op": "RunLine",
          "operands": [
            "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_073ad0d",
            0.0
          ],
          "source": "MushroomEater: Это страшное место, куда никогда не ступала нога человека.",
          "sourceStableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456989253636",
          "target": "MushroomEater: Kakila-kilabot na lugar iyon na hindi pa natatapakan ng sinumang tao."
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "opcode": 2,
          "op": "RunLine",
          "operands": [
            "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_0171e1f",
            0.0
          ],
          "source": "MushroomEater: И поверь, лучше бы так и было. Но у нас нет выбора.",
          "sourceStableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456989253637",
          "target": "MushroomEater: At maniwala ka, mas mabuti sana kung ganoon nga. Pero wala tayong pagpipilian."
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "opcode": 2,
          "op": "RunLine",
          "operands": [
            "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_04ffb00",
            0.0
          ],
          "source": "MushroomEater: Нам надо остановить фестиваль грибов во что бы то ни стало.",
          "sourceStableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456989253638",
          "target": "MushroomEater: Kailangan nating pigilan ang Pista ng mga kabute anuman ang mangyari."
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "opcode": 2,
          "op": "RunLine",
          "operands": [
            "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_0bc81ca",
            0.0
          ],
          "source": "MushroomEater: Ты готов отправиться в страну грибов?",
          "sourceStableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456989253639",
          "target": "MushroomEater: Handa ka na bang pumunta sa Lupain ng mga kabute?"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "opcode": 4,
          "op": "AddOption",
          "operands": [
            "line:MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_0b12f9e",
            "L2198shortcutoption_MushroomEater_Entrance_3_3_1",
            0.0,
            false
          ],
          "source": "Да",
          "sourceStableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504456989253640",
          "target": "Oo"
        },
        {
